= The New Face of Socialism

The meeting is fruitful, bringing together various progressive groups interested in profound economic and social change and includes the -> Socialist Party of Canada (Primarily of BC), United Farmers of Alberta (Alberta), Dominion Labor Party (Alberta), Canadian Labour Party (Primarily Alberta), United Farmers of Canada (Saskatchewan Section), Independent Labour Party (Manitoba), and the Canadian Brotherhood of Railway Employees.

